WEBVTT

00:11.017 --> 00:13.937
KIRINOSHIMA MIDDLE SCHOOL

00:14.021 --> 00:15.564
Our club's so demanding.

00:15.647 --> 00:17.899
I was counting the days
till it was finally over.

00:17.983 --> 00:20.986
You know who's cringe?
Miki. She didn't fit in at all.

00:21.069 --> 00:22.821
- She took it way too seriously.
- I know.

00:22.904 --> 00:25.490
But I was too scared to speak up.

00:25.574 --> 00:27.200
Me too.

00:28.452 --> 00:32.289
<i>I wanted a new environment</i>
<i>where I could change myself.</i>

00:33.040 --> 00:34.416
TOP GRADES GUARANTEED
CRAM SCHOOL

00:34.499 --> 00:37.419
<i>I chose a cram school outside of my city</i>

00:37.502 --> 00:39.880
<i>to get into</i>
<i>an academically competitive high school.</i>

00:43.133 --> 00:44.134
MIKI

00:44.217 --> 00:45.969
<i>I knew this would happen, but…</i>

00:46.053 --> 00:48.430
<i>I don't know anyone here.</i>

00:48.513 --> 00:51.475
<i>Everyone's already formed</i>
<i>their friend groups.</i>

00:51.558 --> 00:53.769
<i>I've got to approach… No, I can't.</i>

00:53.852 --> 00:55.854
FRIEND GROUPS - GIRLS
TERRIFYING COMBINATION

00:55.937 --> 00:58.732
<i>They may act sweet and friendly</i>
<i>on the surface,</i>

00:58.815 --> 01:03.236
<i>but they'll talk bad about me</i>
<i>behind my back.</i>

01:03.820 --> 01:04.821
GROAN

01:04.905 --> 01:08.617
<i>I'm tearing up just thinking about it.</i>
<i>It's turned into trauma.</i>

01:16.249 --> 01:17.626
<i>I'm so lonely.</i>

01:19.836 --> 01:22.881
Hey, you here alone? Care if I sit by you?

01:28.345 --> 01:29.930
- Who are you?
- Me?

01:30.514 --> 01:32.432
My name's Minato Amamiya.

02:58.351 --> 03:03.982
THE RAMPARTS OF ICE

03:04.649 --> 03:08.987
EPISODE 3
3+(←)1

03:09.070 --> 03:11.990
MEITEN HIGH SCHOOL

03:12.073 --> 03:15.201
Hear me out.
Why does the upcoming exam cover so much?

03:15.285 --> 03:17.829
Why didn't you start studying earlier?

03:17.913 --> 03:20.874
This is off topic, but why are you back?

03:20.957 --> 03:24.252
I forgot to grab my notebook.
I wanna study it today.

03:25.837 --> 03:27.297
- The torture never ends!
- Sheesh.

03:27.797 --> 03:29.466
<i>A four-man study session.</i>

03:30.800 --> 03:34.262
<i>It feels a little strange.</i>

03:35.221 --> 03:38.767
Listen, Miki. We broke up.

03:38.850 --> 03:40.852
What? Again? When?

03:40.936 --> 03:42.229
Two days ago.

03:42.312 --> 03:45.148
What? That's super recent!
What happened? What'd you do?

03:45.232 --> 03:47.442
Why do you assume it's my fault?

03:47.525 --> 03:48.818
Well, you know…

03:48.902 --> 03:49.903
LIVELY CHATTER

03:49.986 --> 03:52.739
<i>Should I be listening?</i>

03:52.822 --> 03:55.659
- She called me because she wanted to meet.
- <i>What a personal thing to talk about…</i>

03:55.742 --> 03:59.162
Man, I'm always getting dumped.

03:59.246 --> 04:00.664
<i>That's what bothers you?</i>

04:02.249 --> 04:04.376
What? Didn't expect it?

04:04.459 --> 04:05.710
Huh? No…

04:06.253 --> 04:08.046
How do I put it?

04:11.174 --> 04:14.552
Well, it's like…

04:16.721 --> 04:19.307
when you just go through a break up,

04:19.391 --> 04:22.769
I thought you're supposed
to be depressed or resentful.

04:24.562 --> 04:25.563
Not at all.

04:27.107 --> 04:32.320
On the contrary, I'm thankful
they liked me, even for a short time.

04:32.404 --> 04:33.655
Capisce?

04:34.155 --> 04:35.156
You hear this guy?

04:35.240 --> 04:36.324
Gee.

04:38.410 --> 04:41.204
<i>Guess that's how some people see it.</i>

04:42.914 --> 04:44.958
- You think I'm a player, huh?
- <i>He got me.</i>

04:45.959 --> 04:49.546
I may not look it, but I'm heartbroken.

04:50.547 --> 04:54.384
<i>Of course he is.</i>
<i>That was insensitive of me.</i>

04:54.884 --> 04:55.969
FEELING DOWN

04:56.052 --> 04:58.054
Sorry, I guess.

05:00.140 --> 05:03.560
Then, why don't you comfort me?

05:09.357 --> 05:11.693
Okay, that's enough from you!

05:11.776 --> 05:14.237
Minato, you're kinda like this.

05:14.321 --> 05:15.947
Your grip!

05:16.031 --> 05:20.785
Koyun, you can brush off
whatever Minato says.

05:20.869 --> 05:22.203
- 'Kay.
- How come?

05:26.041 --> 05:27.292
Miki?

05:27.876 --> 05:30.253
Yota-sensei, so, about this part…

05:33.340 --> 05:35.592
- Oops, there I go again.
- Ugh, again.

05:35.675 --> 05:37.552
Yota, you klutz!

05:37.635 --> 05:38.803
Klutz?

05:38.887 --> 05:42.223
What am I gonna do with you?
Always dropping things.

05:42.307 --> 05:43.433
Oh, shoot.

05:45.518 --> 05:48.104
FLUSTER FLUSTER
UGH!

05:48.688 --> 05:50.356
Here. Is that everything?

05:50.440 --> 05:51.566
Thanks.

05:57.030 --> 05:59.741
<i>She laughs just like the rest of us.</i>

06:02.660 --> 06:03.661
<i>Oh, well.</i>

06:05.747 --> 06:08.458
See ya. We're heading this way.

06:08.541 --> 06:09.834
Don't want us to walk with you?

06:09.918 --> 06:12.295
No thanks, but I appreciate the offer.

06:12.378 --> 06:16.049
I'm with her.
It's time for my grip strength to shine!

06:16.132 --> 06:17.884
Hey, it's actually really powerful.

06:17.967 --> 06:19.886
You be careful too, Miki.

06:21.971 --> 06:25.016
Bye, guys! Thanks again, Yota!

06:25.100 --> 06:27.477
What about me? I helped you with English.

06:27.560 --> 06:28.561
Thanks to you too.

06:28.645 --> 06:29.646
Am I an afterthought?

06:29.729 --> 06:32.982
Koyun! I want Dyna Potato by the station.
Can we stop by real quick?

06:33.066 --> 06:34.067
DYNAMITE POTATO

06:34.150 --> 06:36.069
I'm down, but what about dinner at home?

06:36.152 --> 06:38.822
Don't worry! It'll be an appetizer.

06:39.322 --> 06:40.406
Liar.

06:40.490 --> 06:42.659
I've got a separate stomach for it.

06:42.742 --> 06:44.869
Miki sure loves to chat.

06:44.953 --> 06:46.663
She should be like that all the time.

06:47.997 --> 06:49.582
What're you up to today, Yota?

06:50.875 --> 06:52.794
Wiener dog!

06:53.378 --> 06:55.213
I'll chomp on this
and head to the community center.

06:55.296 --> 06:58.550
You're kidding.
It's gonna catch up with you someday.

06:59.342 --> 07:01.136
Wanna have dinner at my place?

07:01.219 --> 07:03.138
My mom's always happy to see you.

07:04.222 --> 07:06.099
I'll pass. Thanks though.

07:06.182 --> 07:07.183
See ya.

07:09.769 --> 07:11.104
Don't overdo it.

07:11.688 --> 07:12.814
I know.

07:14.774 --> 07:16.317
With everything. I mean it.

07:21.739 --> 07:24.117
<i>Yota acts that way,</i>

07:24.742 --> 07:25.910
<i>but as for her…</i>

07:27.162 --> 07:28.872
<i>What's on her mind?</i>

07:31.291 --> 07:35.128
<i>What if she has a crush on him?</i>

07:39.591 --> 07:42.093
I wouldn't go for Yota if I were you.

07:48.391 --> 07:49.392
Wait for me!

07:49.476 --> 07:52.979
Koyun, how long have you known Minato?

07:54.355 --> 07:56.774
Huh? We only recently met.

07:56.858 --> 07:59.736
It was a little before
we walked home together.

08:01.112 --> 08:03.656
He approached me
at the bottom of the staircase, and…

08:03.740 --> 08:04.741
What'd he say to you?

08:08.620 --> 08:09.621
Huh?

08:13.791 --> 08:15.668
What did he say?

08:17.086 --> 08:20.215
Well, we really didn't talk about
anything important.

08:21.549 --> 08:22.800
Sorry.

08:22.884 --> 08:25.595
Koyun, you're kinda like this.

08:28.556 --> 08:31.768
Well, then it's fine, I guess.

08:33.645 --> 08:35.021
<i>Miki…</i>

08:45.031 --> 08:46.491
<i>Could it be that she…</i>

08:54.415 --> 08:56.376
<i>I overslept.</i>

08:58.253 --> 09:02.173
<i>I wanted to start walking</i>
<i>when no one's on their way to school.</i>

09:03.967 --> 09:06.678
<i>That's at least half an hour earlier.</i>

09:09.722 --> 09:11.975
<i>Early morning during the exam period,</i>

09:12.058 --> 09:15.520
<i>that's when the path to school</i>
<i>becomes quiet for a change.</i>

09:15.603 --> 09:16.813
<i>This kind of vibe…</i>

09:25.905 --> 09:27.865
<i>For some reason, I like it.</i>

09:31.119 --> 09:33.329
Hikawa, do you usually
walk to school around this time?

09:33.413 --> 09:35.248
- Huh?
- Morning.

09:35.832 --> 09:39.085
Here I was, thinking I left a tad early.

09:39.586 --> 09:40.753
That's admirable.

09:40.837 --> 09:41.838
No…

09:44.215 --> 09:47.010
<i>I come much later</i>
<i>when it's not exam period.</i>

09:47.093 --> 09:50.597
<i>And I planned</i>
<i>on leaving much earlier this morning.</i>

09:50.680 --> 09:52.599
<i>Ugh, it'll take too long to explain.</i>

09:53.850 --> 09:56.227
Not at all.

10:04.861 --> 10:06.404
<i>Common interests…</i>

10:09.574 --> 10:10.783
Say, Hikawa,

10:11.534 --> 10:13.620
do you know a guy named Igarashi?

10:15.371 --> 10:17.624
<i>Wait. What?</i>

10:17.707 --> 10:20.376
<i>What did he say just now?</i>

10:22.086 --> 10:23.212
<i>Igarashi?</i>

10:24.672 --> 10:26.674
Why'd you ask? Do you know him?

10:26.758 --> 10:30.887
My soccer club has joint practice
with West High from time to time.

10:30.970 --> 10:32.639
That's where I met him.

10:33.348 --> 10:37.226
Were you friends with him? He might
recognize you if I told him your name.

10:37.310 --> 10:40.146
No. We had no connection whatsoever.

10:41.147 --> 10:43.024
He wouldn't recognize me
even if you told him my name.

10:43.983 --> 10:45.109
I see.

10:45.193 --> 10:48.821
Well, he's coming to our school, but
you wouldn't recognize each other then.

10:48.905 --> 10:49.947
When is that?

10:50.031 --> 10:52.909
It'll be during club activities
on the afternoon of the last day of exams.

10:52.992 --> 10:53.993
Really.

10:54.577 --> 10:56.579
<i>I'm definitely leaving early.</i>

10:59.707 --> 11:03.461
<i>Wait, if he's asking me about him, then…</i>

11:03.961 --> 11:06.839
<i>Is Amamiya good friends with Igarashi?</i>

11:06.923 --> 11:09.133
Joint practice starts
right as the exams end.

11:09.217 --> 11:12.095
- We're pullin' out all the stops.
- <i>They even mentioned their middle schools.</i>

11:12.679 --> 11:14.597
West High's exams are also…

11:15.515 --> 11:19.018
<i>Oh, no. I can't pay attention</i>
<i>to what he's saying at all.</i>

11:33.491 --> 11:37.370
I brought questions
for last year's finals today.

11:37.870 --> 11:40.289
Apparently, the test for subjects
like History barely changes.

11:40.790 --> 11:43.042
What? How'd you get your hands on it?

11:43.126 --> 11:45.878
Let's just say I asked
for a tiny favor from a senior.

11:47.255 --> 11:49.215
You're coming to my classroom
after school again, right?

11:52.468 --> 11:54.345
Well, later then.

11:54.846 --> 11:55.888
BOW

12:00.810 --> 12:03.146
Morning. It's been like, what, yesterday?

12:04.480 --> 12:06.065
<i>What do I even say?</i>

12:07.525 --> 12:10.570
<i>He's not a shy one. He can talk to anyone.</i>

12:10.653 --> 12:11.904
STRONG COMMUNICATOR

12:16.200 --> 12:18.536
<i>Miki has a crush on…</i>

12:19.579 --> 12:22.373
<i>No, it's only a guess at this point.</i>

12:23.624 --> 12:27.962
<i>Miki looked clearly bothered</i>
<i>that me and Amamiya knew each other.</i>

12:30.131 --> 12:32.508
<i>His connection with Igarashi</i>
<i>is worrisome too.</i>

12:33.176 --> 12:36.387
<i>This might be a good time</i>
<i>for me to take a step back from it all.</i>

12:41.517 --> 12:42.977
SIGH

12:43.060 --> 12:45.521
All I want is some peace.

12:51.652 --> 12:53.488
<i>Koyun and Minato…</i>

12:58.451 --> 12:59.452
This guy's Yota.

12:59.535 --> 13:00.661
He's massive.

13:01.829 --> 13:04.207
My younger brother's a tough one like me.

13:04.749 --> 13:06.918
Yup. My cram school just ended.

13:07.001 --> 13:08.920
Yup, I'm at the usual convenience store.

13:09.003 --> 13:10.421
What're you worried about?

13:10.505 --> 13:12.507
Wonder what sides everyone brought today.

13:12.590 --> 13:13.883
Yeah, lookin' forward to lunch!

13:14.383 --> 13:16.385
Hey Miki. Let's swap our sides.

13:16.469 --> 13:17.887
Let's!

13:20.515 --> 13:21.933
Hikawa.

13:22.016 --> 13:24.727
It's good that
you're a serious student and all,

13:24.810 --> 13:27.063
but you should at least
have some fun during lunch.

13:27.688 --> 13:29.690
But the teacher's room is warm.

13:29.774 --> 13:31.567
What are you? A cat?

13:32.151 --> 13:33.986
Anyway, got a question for me?

13:34.070 --> 13:37.740
You do it like this, and it becomes this.
That's how you get the answer.

13:37.823 --> 13:39.575
That makes sense.

13:40.159 --> 13:42.453
Now, be on your way. Go.

13:42.537 --> 13:43.746
- Shoo.
- Tsk.

13:43.829 --> 13:45.581
I'll go visit Noriko then.

13:45.665 --> 13:47.708
Stop going room to room for the heater.

13:49.460 --> 13:51.254
She stops by here often.

13:51.337 --> 13:52.713
Yes, she does.

13:53.589 --> 13:57.426
<i>I've never seen her</i>
<i>hang out with the other students.</i>

13:57.510 --> 13:58.719
<i>I'm concerned for her.</i>

14:00.805 --> 14:03.975
Perhaps she finds it easier
to speak to adults.

14:04.642 --> 14:09.730
There's a clear distance
between a teacher and a student.

14:10.398 --> 14:12.984
She knows there's a line you won't cross,

14:13.067 --> 14:15.903
and that's why she feels at ease with you.

14:16.571 --> 14:19.991
I want the students to be besties
and enjoy their youth together!

14:20.074 --> 14:21.367
THE TEEN YEARS GO BY IN A FLASH!

14:21.450 --> 14:24.453
Suwa-sensei, you should know
that forcing your good intentions

14:24.537 --> 14:27.123
can end up hurting people.

14:27.206 --> 14:30.501
Matsumoto, what happened to you?

14:31.502 --> 14:36.465
Let's see. My paint set and sketchbook…

14:37.091 --> 14:40.511
<i>- Is that everything for today's class?</i>
- I'm saying it for your own good.

14:40.595 --> 14:43.598
- No, seriously.
- You gotta know your limits.

14:43.681 --> 14:44.765
POKE OUT

14:44.849 --> 14:46.142
Can I take your word for it?

14:46.225 --> 14:47.518
<i>It's Amamiya.</i>

14:47.602 --> 14:48.686
FLASHBACK

14:48.769 --> 14:50.605
- <i>Why did you ignore me?</i>
- <i>I'm reminded.</i>

14:50.688 --> 14:51.689
<i>I need some distance.</i>

14:52.356 --> 14:56.319
<i>No, wait.</i>
<i>He's surrounded by people I don't know.</i>

14:56.402 --> 14:58.696
<i>Besides, he hasn't noticed me.</i>

14:58.779 --> 15:00.531
<i>Remember, I need some distance!</i>

15:01.866 --> 15:04.035
<i>This is fine. I'm not ignoring him.</i>

15:05.119 --> 15:09.415
<i>I'll stay quiet</i>
<i>so he walks off without noticing.</i>

15:10.166 --> 15:12.919
<i>No, he's looking right at me.</i>

15:13.002 --> 15:14.837
BOW
THE QUICK BOW AND DIP OUT STRATEGY

15:14.921 --> 15:15.922
Hi.

15:17.506 --> 15:18.507
YAY

15:18.591 --> 15:20.051
<i>Man, he's so expressive</i>
<i>with his movements.</i>

15:20.134 --> 15:21.135
HELLO THERE

15:21.218 --> 15:23.095
- What is it?
- Stare.

15:23.179 --> 15:24.180
STARE

15:24.263 --> 15:25.640
<i>Stop it! Make it stop!</i>

15:25.723 --> 15:27.934
<i>Please, don't mind me!</i>

15:28.517 --> 15:29.644
Gimme a sec.

15:30.645 --> 15:32.521
<i>Wait. He's coming over!</i>

15:32.605 --> 15:34.690
<i>There really isn't a need to do this.</i>

15:38.027 --> 15:39.195
What're you doing?

15:40.279 --> 15:42.865
You should've just said hi.

15:42.949 --> 15:44.241
There's no need to peek out.

15:44.742 --> 15:45.910
But…

15:45.993 --> 15:47.578
Before I forget.

15:48.162 --> 15:49.956
Tell me your contact info.

15:50.456 --> 15:51.457
<i>Distance!</i>

15:58.965 --> 15:59.966
Thanks.

16:03.052 --> 16:04.470
What's in that bag?

16:05.388 --> 16:09.141
I'm headed to Art next, so…

16:09.225 --> 16:10.768
I see.

16:10.851 --> 16:13.020
Class 2's elective is Art.

16:13.104 --> 16:15.189
What're you doing? Oil paint?

16:16.399 --> 16:19.694
No, we're doing acrylic gouache right now.

16:19.777 --> 16:21.237
Good luck!

16:25.199 --> 16:26.450
<i>Miki.</i>

16:28.452 --> 16:30.121
- Oops.
- What is it?

16:30.204 --> 16:32.873
Sorry. Switching classrooms. Gotta go.

16:32.957 --> 16:33.958
Time to get going!

16:34.041 --> 16:35.042
WHOOSH

16:37.378 --> 16:39.046
She was by herself again.

16:41.215 --> 16:42.216
SMILE
WITH YOTA

16:42.299 --> 16:43.300
Hey, Yota.

16:43.384 --> 16:44.385
PHEW - TEEHEE - SMILE

16:44.468 --> 16:45.469
WITH MINATO

16:45.553 --> 16:46.929
I meant to stop by my locker.

16:47.013 --> 16:48.639
Switching classrooms.

16:49.724 --> 16:54.311
<i>She acts way too differently between</i>
<i>the people she likes and everyone else.</i>

16:54.979 --> 16:57.648
EVERYONE ELSE

17:00.901 --> 17:02.028
Heya.

17:02.111 --> 17:04.739
You approached the Queen
like it's nothing.

17:04.822 --> 17:06.574
You've got a heart of steel.

17:06.657 --> 17:09.910
Well, I was hoping we could be friends.

17:09.994 --> 17:11.662
But she ran away from me.

17:13.122 --> 17:14.331
Now I'm sad.

17:14.415 --> 17:17.418
As if you know what it's like to be sad.

17:17.501 --> 17:19.837
- For real.
- Come on, that's rude.

17:28.721 --> 17:30.681
Here they are. Last years' questions!

17:31.265 --> 17:33.684
Minato, you're godly!

17:33.768 --> 17:36.729
This will be my ticket
to ace the subjects heavy on memorization.

17:36.812 --> 17:38.856
You're not in the position to relax yet.

17:38.939 --> 17:39.940
Keep your guard up.

17:40.024 --> 17:44.320
The last math test
had a super low average score,

17:44.403 --> 17:46.405
so there's a chance it'll be fairly easy.

17:46.489 --> 17:48.449
I hope that's the case.

17:48.532 --> 17:51.786
And what was your score
on this test with a low average, Yota?

17:52.953 --> 17:54.455
Say something!

17:54.538 --> 17:58.292
Yota, you could've enrolled at East High.

17:58.375 --> 18:00.336
They've got a decent basketball team too.

18:00.419 --> 18:01.670
Why'd you pick Meiten?

18:01.754 --> 18:04.465
Huh? Because I live close by.

18:04.548 --> 18:07.218
That's why you chose this school?
And you're happy with that?

18:07.301 --> 18:08.302
Come on,

18:08.385 --> 18:12.098
he can't tell you that he deliberately
chose a school below his academic level

18:12.181 --> 18:15.935
so he can rank near the top and aim
for a designated-school recommendation.

18:16.018 --> 18:17.561
That's how it is.

18:17.645 --> 18:20.523
Hey. Minato, it's really not like that.

18:20.606 --> 18:22.566
Guess we're worlds apart.

18:22.650 --> 18:23.984
Miki!

18:27.321 --> 18:29.698
Koyun, you're locked in today.

18:30.366 --> 18:31.784
Hey! You changed the subject.

18:32.368 --> 18:35.830
Well, I wanted to get
some distractions off my mind.

18:36.705 --> 18:39.083
What? Is something distracting you?

18:39.166 --> 18:40.918
Yup. All sorts of things, actually.

18:45.214 --> 18:47.675
<i>Like I thought.</i>
<i>She acts totally different.</i>

18:48.592 --> 18:52.263
Hikawa, do you have a boyfriend?

18:54.557 --> 18:55.599
What?

18:56.684 --> 18:58.853
No, but…

19:00.229 --> 19:02.022
<i>Why's he asking all of a sudden?</i>

19:02.940 --> 19:04.066
Okay, then.

19:05.442 --> 19:06.735
<i>What is it?</i>

19:06.819 --> 19:09.280
<i>What's the point of asking</i>
<i>something like that?</i>

19:09.864 --> 19:11.782
Do you know a guy named Igarashi?

19:14.326 --> 19:18.038
<i>Is Igarashi trying</i>
<i>to dig around through him?</i>

19:18.622 --> 19:21.208
<i>No, I'm definitely overthinking it.</i>

19:21.292 --> 19:23.085
<i>As if he'd get someone else to ask.</i>

19:23.586 --> 19:26.630
<i>It was a long time ago.</i>
<i>He wouldn't take it this far.</i>

19:27.214 --> 19:28.257
Minato.

19:29.425 --> 19:31.427
You can't aim for her, all right?

19:36.182 --> 19:38.058
<i>Is that what this is about?</i>

19:38.642 --> 19:40.436
Can't I have her, Father?

19:40.519 --> 19:42.021
You won't date my daughter.

19:42.104 --> 19:43.731
<i>They're joking around.</i>

19:45.858 --> 19:47.693
<i>See, I was just overthinking.</i>

19:48.277 --> 19:51.447
<i>Self-conscious and paranoid…</i>

19:51.530 --> 19:52.948
<i>I'm ashamed.</i>

19:54.033 --> 19:55.576
<i>Wait. What about Miki?</i>

19:56.368 --> 19:57.870
<i>Blank!</i>

19:58.537 --> 20:00.497
<i>I can't get a good read</i>
<i>on what she's thinking.</i>

20:00.581 --> 20:02.374
<i>What do I do?</i>

20:02.458 --> 20:05.336
<i>I can't even tell what</i>
<i>my childhood friend's feeling.</i>

20:07.171 --> 20:10.424
I'm gonna replenish on sugar.

20:10.925 --> 20:12.009
SUGAR

20:13.177 --> 20:15.221
I'm gonna check out the vending machine.

20:15.304 --> 20:17.348
I'll grab something
for Koyun and Yota too.

20:17.431 --> 20:18.432
What about me?

20:18.515 --> 20:21.101
- You get your own.
- Hey!

20:22.186 --> 20:24.438
So, come with me.

20:30.194 --> 20:32.363
Huh? Sure.

20:36.951 --> 20:38.202
We'll be back soon.

20:45.251 --> 20:46.418
<i>Miki…</i>

20:48.003 --> 20:50.965
Hey, Miki. What was that about?

20:55.970 --> 20:58.389
I read the manga
you told me about, Ishida.

20:58.472 --> 21:01.267
See you later, Yoshino!

21:01.350 --> 21:05.396
Yamashita! About that anime you mentioned.

21:05.479 --> 21:08.148
- I watched it. It was good.
- You know,

21:08.232 --> 21:10.442
Minato's such a social butterfly.

21:10.526 --> 21:12.278
He's like that at school too.

21:12.361 --> 21:13.362
Really.

21:14.905 --> 21:17.992
<i>I'm jealous. I wish I could be like him.</i>

21:18.075 --> 21:19.868
Apparently, Minato

21:19.952 --> 21:23.580
can't help but intervene
when someone seems lonely.

21:24.540 --> 21:27.501
- What?
- It's like he pities them.

21:29.545 --> 21:31.463
<i>Pities them?</i>

21:37.970 --> 21:40.472
Here, I'll pay.

21:40.556 --> 21:42.474
I meant to buy Hikawa a drink anyway.

21:46.520 --> 21:47.688
Why?

21:48.272 --> 21:52.192
The other day, I tried
to talk to her here but it made her jump.

21:52.276 --> 21:55.446
She ended up buying
a super weird drink on accident.

21:55.529 --> 21:56.530
AUTHENTIC CURRY DRINK

21:56.613 --> 21:57.948
That's the one.

21:58.032 --> 21:59.867
I'd forgotten all about it until now.

22:06.332 --> 22:07.958
Say, Minato…

22:12.296 --> 22:14.465
What do you think of Koyun?

22:22.097 --> 22:23.098
What?

23:50.310 --> 23:55.315
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
